OL,3,GNEWSAShared parental leave plans a
OL,4,A'critical priority'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe development of proposals for shared
OL,7,Fparental leave is a "critical
OL,8,Fpriority", the Committee for Employment
OL,9,Fand Social Security (ESS) has said.
OL,11,FCurrently, there is no provision for
OL,12,Fstatutory shared parental leave, but
OL,13,Fpartners of new mothers are entitled to
OL,14,Ftwo weeks unpaid maternity support
OL,15,Fleave.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
