OL,1,W5j 5Q7+jp5w{j#57kjs15  jjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShared parental leave plans a
OL,4,A'critical priority'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a committee update, ESS President
OL,7,FTina Bury said the island was "so far
OL,8,Fbehind" other places on the issue. She
OL,9,Fadded: "We are able to see what has
OL,10,Fbeen implemented elsewhere, how it's
OL,11,Fbeen improved elsewhere, and we can now
OL,12,Fbenefit from that."
OL,14,FOther critical priorities for the
OL,15,Fcommittee listed by Bury included
OL,16,Flong-term care, changes to social
OL,17,Fsecurity and identifying savings
OL,18,Fopportunities.
